    <node id="&quot;WARWICKSHIRE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Warwickshire is a county in England, home to various built-up areas including Kingswood, Leek Wootton, Lighthorne Heath, Long Compton, Long Itchington, Long Lawford, Long Marston, Lower Brailes, Lower Quinton, and Mancetter (Witherley), and includes the villages of Sherborne and Sherbourne."&lt;SEP&gt;"Warwickshire is mentioned as a separate location, distinct from Sherborne."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0110-a7a91f25c6d3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WARWICK DISTRICT&quot;">
